        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "African milkbush is cultivated in tropical gardens as well as a container plant. Plants are typically grown from cuttings and are regarded as easy to cultivate in gardens. The cultivar 'Rubra' with solid purple-red leaves is valued by gardeners for adding year round color to landscapes.",
